  "_doc": "Each weapon names the library's single-shot recordings of one firearm: near ('near distance, front of shooter' in the library's master sheet) become the close layers, mid ('mid distance') the distant layer. The library's burst recordings are not used: every round the game fires is built from single shots. Input to the audio pipeline (gradlew prepareAudio -> absentialis.tools.AudioPrep). Originals live under tools/audio/originals and are never modified; everything under assets/audio is generated from them and can be regenerated. Licences, authors and URLs for every source are in docs/audio/weapon_asset_manifest.md and ATTRIBUTION.md.",
